But how do you find out a shark's age?

5
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:09,960
You look inside its eyes.

6
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:13,040
A 2016 study carbon-dated the lenses in

7
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:13,860
